#: PackageDetailDockWidget.cpp:384
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Shaman is waiting for an exclusive lock on the package management system"
msgstr ""

#: PackageDetailDockWidget.cpp:385
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"To operate correctly, Shaman must be the only application acting on %1, the "
"package management system.\n"
"Shaman detected that another running application, such as another frontend "
"or a terminal program, is holding a lock on it. Please close it to resume "
"normal operation"
msgstr ""

